---
title: 護衛先と襲撃先が一致すると襲撃が無効化され peace event が emit される
setup: { bodyguard: 1, werewolf: 1, villager: 2 }
rules:
  first-victim: none
---
# 1夜: Alice (狩) が Carol を護衛、 Bob (狼) が Carol を襲撃 → 護衛成功で
# Carol は死なず、 engine は peace event を emit する。
# Day 1 で Dave 処刑 (狼を残し Night 1 まで進める)、 Day 2 で Bob 処刑 → 終局
# (終局は検証対象外)。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave
!Alice=狩人
!Bob=人狼
!Carol=村人
!Dave=村人
!Alice 1夜 護衛 Carol
!Bob 1夜 襲撃 Carol

# == engine: Night 0 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Alice→Dave
Bob→Dave
Carol→Dave
Dave→Alice

# == engine: Day 1 ==
# vote tally: Dave 3 / Alice 1 → execution=Dave
# == end ==
# == engine: Night 1 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Day 2:

Alice→Bob
Carol→Bob
Bob→Alice

# == engine: Day 2 ==
# vote tally: Bob 2 / Alice 1 → execution=Bob
# == end ==
# == engine: Final ==
# result: villager_won
# survivors: Alice, Carol
# == end ==

# @expect-event peace
# @expect-status Carol: alive
